<title>UK: CRICKET-ENGLISH COUNTY CHAMPIONSHIP CLOSE SCORE.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-ENGLISH COUNTY CHAMPIONSHIP CLOSE SCORE.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Close of play score on the third day of a four-day English county championship match playing Sunday:</p>
<p>At The Oval: Surrey 201-9 declared (P.Franks 4-47), Nottinghamshire 73-1.</p>
